# Caption
An aggressive neurofunk track that opens with an atmospheric pad before launching into a frantic drum and bass rhythm driven by heavily processed breakbeats and a distorted reese-style synth lead. The intro features a signature wobble bass effect reminiscent of dubstep or complextro. Following a brief breakdown centered on a simple chiptune-like melody over a steady beat, the track slams back into its high-energy neurofunk section with intense rhythmic edits and growling synths. A second build-up introduces another powerful drop characterized by complex sound design and driving percussion, concluding with a fade-out featuring a repeating vocal sample effect.

# Metas
- bpm: 174
- timesignature: 4
- keyscale: F minor
- duration: 44 seconds
