# Caption
An aggressive, high-energy hardstyle track driven by a relentless, heavily distorted kick drum and a screeching, detuned synth lead. The track opens with a tense, accelerating synth arpeggio that rapidly sweeps upwards in pitch, building anticipation before slamming into the main drop. The core of the song features a powerful, pounding four-on-the-floor rhythm with the characteristic rawstyle kick dominating the mix. A brief, atmospheric breakdown provides a moment of contrast with filtered pads and a simple arpeggio before a second, even more intense buildup reintroduces the screeching lead and pushes the energy to its peak for the final section.

